{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-09_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-09","title":"解開鈴鐺","storyCode":"6-10","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"665757496307425d7ab1bbd9ba753b352d6740329269cec57c86d49959024542","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"面對近衛局和雨披部隊的進攻，雪怪小隊全力守著唯一的出口。\n霜星發揮自己的能力逼退了敵人，然而她的身體情況已經到達了極限。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"擊退那些穿黑雨披的了！你們，趁這個機會，趕緊走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"別謝，有餘力的話，最好能和我們一起戰鬥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到他從四層樓上蕩下來，從我頭頂上劃過去那招嗎？要不是我用背包裡大姊的源石凍住了他的武器，我已經沒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"真厲害啊，感覺和烏薩斯的防毒面具軍刀人一個意思了，不，可能更強！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"差點就沒命，怎麼還這麼興奮？你說的面具軍刀可是烏薩斯皇帝內衛！我們那次也只是碰巧遇上五個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你數得清有幾個雨披嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"這說明我們比以前更厲害了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"現在不是開玩笑的時候，他們的戰鬥技巧和那身裝備，肯定要一個城邦......甚至幾個城邦的工業支持才能夠成立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"沒其他小隊的幫助，我們根本不可能擊退他們，別說讓他們減員了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我就......就覺得自己還挺努力的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在的事態明顯超出我們的掌控範圍了......我們也沒法撐太長時間！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"安靜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"報到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊。這幾位是......浮士德的隊員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......我記得你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......霜星。我們收到了你的通訊，就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_17"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特怎麼在你們這？他怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特他似乎......精神受到了一點創傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他？會精神受創？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，浮士德呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德他為了讓我們和其他小隊順利撤退，留在了貧民區之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那種情況下，很難生還。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德是個好戰士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星，如果可以，我們想和雪怪一起戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"可以。我們必須讓剩下的同胞都順利逃生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"去狙擊位待命，之後的戰鬥，我們一定需要你們的援助。我們不知道敵人會在什麼時候再發動進攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"收到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"通報，把我們的位置傳給各個小隊！讓他們迅速從這裡撤退，我們會保證行進路線的安全！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續去疏散人群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"他們和烏薩斯士兵一樣，完全不顧及周圍的地形和人群啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得不一樣，烏薩斯可是敢在上城區裡調用艦炮的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"早知道他們很冷酷，但居然還有這種事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們真遇見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"這些穿雨衣的確實不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"平民在他們眼裡不是障礙，而是同樣的目標，因為沒法分辨誰是感染者誰不是，他們也不知道我們是不是裝扮成了平民的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"那烏薩斯是不管不顧，這些人則是一個都不放過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"逃難的人很多，已經快維持不住秩序了！霜星還真是會給人出難題啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊是絕對不會見死不救的，這不分整合運動不整合運動的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"本來是打算來龍門加入作戰的，怎麼一來就淨救人了，夠奇怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"還作戰呢，已經徹底玩完了，沒你們來支援，我們就全死這裡了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"很嚴重啊。真就全指望我們了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"別用這種很了不起的口氣說話......以前我還覺得你們很可怕，現在，完了，像個街頭喜劇演員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你對我們有誤解，我們只是沒怎麼說過話，可怕應該說不上啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"就一點，別說指望不指望，我們不是在和你們一起在這防守的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"說得對！兄弟，讓我們守住這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"是......我們在這裡發現了被困在室內的本地人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"一對母女。我們打算把這裡佈置成火力點，但不知道怎麼和她們溝通......她們似乎被我嚇到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（當地語言）！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（當地語言）......（當地語言）......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......她是你的孩子，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇......哇......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"真是健康的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，別怕，別怕。不哭，你媽媽在你身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"有媽媽在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，哇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，哎......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這小孩居然笑了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"快帶她走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......（當地語言）？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你們幾個，咳，護送她走。去安全的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"她們母女是非感染者，我們還有很多同胞沒撤出，沒多少時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是，都這時候了，還分什麼我啊你的。明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，呃，女士，嗯......zhebianzou？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍門市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"nimen，nimen......hao。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星姊，記得等我們回來。可別再強撐著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"別小看大姊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......快走！他們來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"還有穿其他制服的部隊在部署進攻......可能那些才是龍門近衛局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳咳，嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"已經把區域溫度降到最低了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"穿制服的不是我們的對手，但還是得小心那些雨披！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大熊呢？現在的火力太小了，炮火壓制，搞大點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"他說他知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺大姊的身體快到極限了，不能再繼續降溫了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"不能破壞現在的路面結構嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，破壞了道路，整合運動和本地人就沒有別的通道抵達這個出口了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"確定這是唯一出口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"是......所有的其它出口全都被毀了。只有我們破開的這個出口還能用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們還剩下多少時間？不，霜星姊還剩下多少時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼都到這個時候了，還要這麼折磨她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"這批已經差不多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找大姊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊，這批感染者已經全部撤出！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"戰況......呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們完全壓制住了近衛局。地形很適合我們，近衛局沒辦法運用他們的數量優勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼好隱瞞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"穿雨披的龍門部隊絲毫不在乎地形和居民。他們......他們是要徹底摧毀這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在蕩平貧民窟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之前看到那些非感染龍門人的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕也是他們做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊，停止施術吧！這一批我們能幫你擋住，至少休息一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......溫度在突破下限！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"成功了......成功了！鋼骨結構現在已經十分脆弱了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"把他們的落腳點砸了，逼他們撤退！快！射擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"他們被迫後退了，繼續射擊！把他們逼回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，動作快些！快，趁現在，快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"知，知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是大姊，她真的做到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特洛娃，你怎麼了？表情怎麼這麼沉重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......大姊呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"楊格，過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"楊格","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"楊格","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你必須信。大姊她沒剩多少時間了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["霜星"]}]}
